### Listar
GET http://localhost:8080/veiculos
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/veiculos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"marca": "Chevrolet", "modelo": "Vectra", "ano": 1997, "placa": "ABC1D23"}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1

### Filtrar
GET http://localhost:8080/veiculos?marca=CHEVROLET

### Atualizar (todos os campos)
PUT http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"marca": "Chevrolet Atualizado", "modelo": "Vectra", "ano": 1997, "placa": "ABC1D23"}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:8080/veiculos/1

### Inválido: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/veiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{}
